---
<div class="card card--achievements">
  <span class="eyebrow">HIGHLIGHTS</span>
  <h3>Achievements</h3>
  <ul class="achievement-list">
    <li>
      <span class="ach-icon">◆</span>
      <span>Certified SAFe® 5 Practitioner — 2023</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="ach-icon">◆</span>
      <span>5K+ Stack Overflow reputation</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="ach-icon">◆</span>
      <span>Led a team of 15 developers at HCL</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="ach-icon">◆</span>
      <span>Closed 60 defects vs team avg of 10–15</span>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>

<style>
  .achievement-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .achievement-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted-text);
  }

  .ach-icon {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
</style>
